<title>USA: Texarkana to repurchase five pct of shares.</title>
<headline>Texarkana to repurchase five pct of shares.</headline>
<dateline>TEXARKANA, Ark. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texarcana First Financial Corp said on Wednesday that it had authorized the repurchase of up to 94,228 shares, which represents about five percent of the company's outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The repurchases are to be made by the company from time to time in open-market transactions during the next six months, a statement from the company said.</p>
<p>The repurchased shares will be held as treasury stock and will be available for general corporate purposes, the statement said.</p>
</text>
